{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/186848-deprogramming-sleepers","id":186848,"title":"Deprogramming Sleepers","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-02T23:04:03-07:00","id":186848,"title":"Deprogramming Sleepers","content":"DtD makes it pretty clear that sleeper agents are extremely difficult and risky to detect. When a sleeper is activated, is the original personality suppressed, or completely eradicated a la Talia Winters from Babylon 5?<br /> <br /> If it is just suppressed, is there any way to free the sleeper agent of their programming besides a painless death?<br /> <br /> The only means I can think of is to infiltrate the infrastructure that programmed the sleeper, reverse engineer the process used, then pray for a dramatic success.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-02T23:40:05-07:00","id":186890,"title":"","content":"Just because I'm in a mood: the best prescription is two shots of lead directly into the brain. There may be side effects.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-03T04:03:35-07:00","id":186960,"title":"","content":"I personally fall back on the Exploit (or any other method, really) that turns a person into a Stigmagic. Becoming a Stigmatic implies that you are now &quot;aware&quot; of the God-Machine's manipulations, and that theoretically means you should overcome whatever magical mental blocks that were put into your mind that prevents you from remembering what was done to you. And, with that knowledge should come with the ability to make decisions of your own instead of being controlled.<br /> <br /> Naturally, this comes with its own problems. And finding a Sleeper to deprogram isn't exactly easy, as being invisible is kind of their thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-03T18:32:49-07:00","id":187563,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/186848-deprogramming-sleepers?p=186890#post186890\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just because I'm in a mood: the best prescription is two shots of lead directly into the brain. There may be side effects.</div> </div> </div> </div>There just may. Lethal force is good to have as an option, but not as your <i>only</i> option. Dead bodies attract attention, especially if those bodies are connected to you. Bullets are also a non-starter if you need the poor bastard alive, such as an important ally or a valued friend or family member.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/186848-deprogramming-sleepers?p=186960#post186960\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I personally fall back on the Exploit (or any other method, really) that turns a person into a Stigmagic. Becoming a Stigmatic implies that you are now &quot;aware&quot; of the God-Machine's manipulations, and that theoretically means you should overcome whatever magical mental blocks that were put into your mind that prevents you from remembering what was done to you. And, with that knowledge should come with the ability to make decisions of your own instead of being controlled.</div> </div> </div> </div>I like this as a final consequence to deprogramming a sleeper: yes, you saved the poor buggers life, at the cost of putting a target on his back and exposing him to the horrible truth ofthe world of Darkness for the rest of his life. I'm going to make my players go through a few mores hoops beyond inflict Stigmata, boom, sleeper agent neutralized.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-04T06:31:22-07:00","id":187907,"title":"","content":"My thoughts are if your ring have discovered the sleeper agent and seek to reprogram him then there is a similar option to removing a permanent glitch. Finding such an infrastructure that can then be interfered with and deprogram the human. It would involved fighting or infiltrating your way into a likely defended infrastructure, performing an extended action with both the sleeper and the demon suffering from the Plugged In condition and likely involve the ring having to fight more than a few loyalists. But, hey, Neo got Morpheus out just fine, didn't he? (Though your ring might want to take &quot;Like the Movies&quot; just in case.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3036-desolatedolly","name":"DesolateDolly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3036_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-06T02:10:36-07:00","id":189261,"title":"","content":"Or there might be a near field or lambda gadget that can do the trick.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}